      "content": "yeah i'll check the cables. but it's weird because the jitter only seems to happen during high traffic windows. i ran a traceroute from the client side to the gateway and saw the same thing. check this hop:\n\n1  193.253.x.1  2.451 ms  158.210 ms  1.204 ms\n2  193.253.x.5  1.120 ms  149.923 ms  1.098 ms\n3  193.253.x.1  2.330 ms  161.452 ms  2.110 ms\n\nis it possible there's some kind of interference or just some random glitch in the hardware causing these massive jumps? looks almost like it's hitting something and then bouncing back.",
